        "created_at": "2016-06-04T13:42:38.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>While it may take some time, I am satisfied to have painted the miniatures myself:</p><p><span alt=\"All mini's\" class=\"broken-image\" title=\"This image is broken\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-unlink svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#unlink\"></use></svg></span></p><p><span alt=\"Hero mini's\" class=\"broken-image\" title=\"This image is broken\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-unlink svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#unlink\"></use></svg></span></p><p><span alt=\"Villain mini's\" class=\"broken-image\" title=\"This image is broken\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-unlink svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#unlink\"></use></svg></span></p><p>Although I am happy to have finished them, I find myself already looking forward to the Broken city and For profit miniatures! Any chance for an update / teaser picture for those?</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
